1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:03,697
425 ribu kasus ISPA di wilayah karhutla.

2
00:00:03,815 --> 00:00:06,101
Hampir satu dari lima menimpa balita.

3
00:00:06,142 --> 00:00:07,967
Ini data Kementerian Kesehatan,

4
00:00:08,111 --> 00:00:09,546
